WEBVTT

00:08:57.569 --> 00:09:00.490
That brings us back to one
of my favorite puzzles of all time,

00:09:00.514 --> 00:09:02.249
which was constructed by Trip Payne.

00:09:02.273 --> 00:09:05.210
And this time, I'm going to
play it for you with the sound on,

00:09:05.234 --> 00:09:06.823
so get ready to name that tune.

00:09:06.847 --> 00:09:09.109
(Slowed-down mock clucking)

00:09:09.974 --> 00:09:12.537
(Slowed-down mock clucking)

00:09:13.117 --> 00:09:19.452
(Slowed-down mock clucking)

00:09:19.476 --> 00:09:20.626
(Laughter)

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:22.110
Who knows what that is?

00:09:22.825 --> 00:09:24.999
Yeah, "You Make Me Feel
Like a Natural Woman."

00:09:25.023 --> 00:09:29.851
(Laughter)

00:09:29.875 --> 00:09:33.232
So you can identify that
and seven other songs and clips,